 Chestnuts, roasted
 Recipe
Ingredients [
	• 16 oz. fresh chestnuts
	• Water
	• Damp kitchen towel
]
Steps [
	Slit Chestnuts [
		 Cut an 'x' on the rounded side.
	]
	Soak [
		 Cover chestnuts with water and soak for 10-12 hours or overnight.
	]
	Roast [
		 Preheat oven to 350°F. Place chestnuts on baking sheet, slit side up, roast for 30-35 minutes.
	]
	Steam [
		 Wrap chestnuts in a damp towel and let sit for 10-15 minutes.
	]
	Peel [
		 Remove skins while chestnuts are hot.
	]
	Enjoy [
		 Eat plain or use in dishes. Store in fridge for up to 3 days.
	]
]
Alternate Roasting Methods [
	Open Fire [
		 Cast iron skillet, roast 10 min.
	]
	Grill [
		 Grill at 400°F, 15 min.
	]
	Instant Pot [
		 Pressure cook for 15 min.
	]
]